SUMMARY:Bull City Youth Conference
DESCRIPTION:You’re invited to join H.E.A.R.T.S. (Helping Each Adolescent Reach Their Spark) as an attendee\, vendor\, volunteer\, or sponsor at the upcoming Bull City Youth Conference on September 18th and 19th. \nJoin over 100 teens ages 13-19 from across North Carolina for an unforgettable weekend of inspiration\, leadership\, career exploration\, entrepreneurship\, entertainment\, and personal growth. Whether you’re preparing for college\, starting a business\, discovering your purpose\, or simply looking to connect with other young leaders\, the Bull City Youth Conference is designed with YOU in mind. \nExpect interactive workshops\, panel discussions\, motivational keynote speakers\, community resources\, teen networking\, entertainment\, giveaways\, a vendor marketplace\, and youth recognition awards. \nLearn more and register here.
URL:https://resilientdurhamnc.org/event/bull-city-youth-conference/
LOCATION:Doubletree Hilton\, 2515 Meridian Parkway\, Durham\, NC\, United States
END:VEVENT
