SUMMARY:Durham Public School Foundation's 2026-2027 Innovation Grant
DESCRIPTION:The Durham Public Schools Foundation’s 2026–2027 Innovation Grant Cycle is officially OPEN! \nIf you’ve ever had an idea that could make your school\, classroom\, or community even better\, now is the time to bring it to life. DPS Foundation is investing up to $5\,000 in bold\, innovative ideas that expand opportunity\, remove barriers\, and strengthen Durham Public Schools. \nWhether you’re an educator\, student\, family\, staff member\, or community partner\, DPS Foundation believes the people closest to the work are often closest to the solutions\, and they want to invest in your ideas. \nThis Year’s Impact Areas \n\nExpanding Future Pathways\nEmpowering Youth Leaders\nStrengthening Wellbeing\nAdvancing STEM Learning\nElevating Music Education\n\nKey Dates: \n\nApplications Open: July 15\, 2026\nApplication Deadline: September 15\, 2026\nAward Notifications: October 5\, 2026\n\nReady to Get Started? \nVisit the grant portal to begin your application\, download the Applicant Toolkit\, and register for one of DPS Foundation’s support sessions. You can find everything you need via their website: https://www.bullcityschools.org/grants-open
URL:https://resilientdurhamnc.org/event/durham-public-school-foundations-2026-2027-innovation-grant/
END:VEVENT
