SUMMARY:El Futuro's 6th Annual "Expresiones" Art Auction Gala
DESCRIPTION:Get ready for an unforgettable evening at Bay 7\, downtown Durham this fall. El Futuro’s 6th Annual Art Auction & Gala returns on October 17\, 2026\, in a new venue bringing together art\, community\, and purpose to celebrate healing\, hope\, and the power of giving back. Enjoy inspiring artwork\, meaningful connections\, and exciting auction experiences while supporting El Futuro’s mission to expand access to culturally responsive mental health care. Every piece of art\, every bid\, and every guest helps make a difference. \nWhether you come for the art\, the cause\, or the community\, you’ll leave knowing you were part of something bigger. Purchase your tickets today and join El Futuro for a night of art\, generosity\, and lasting impact.
URL:https://resilientdurhamnc.org/event/el-futuros-6th-annual-expresiones-art-auction-gala/
LOCATION:Bay 7\, 324 Blackwell St #700\, Durham\, NC\, 27701\, United States
END:VEVENT
